        "# Day 14 — App Store Fraud, Anomaly & Review Manipulation Surveillance Engine\n",
        "\n",
        "**Project**: Google Play Store Ecosystem Analysis & NLP Autocomplete/Autocorrect Analytics  \n",
        "**Milestone**: Day 14 (Trust & Safety Analytics, Benford's Law Forensic Auditing, Bot Review Incongruity & Security Profiling)  \n",
        "**Focus**: First-digit logarithmic distribution conformance, sentiment-rating dissonance, Shannon lexical entropy bot detection, multivariate Mahalanobis outlier isolation, and prescriptive compliance directives.\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "### Mathematical & Methodological Highlights:\n",
        "1. **Benford's Law First-Digit Auditing**: $P(d) = \\log_{10}(1 + 1/d)$ for $d \\in \\{1, \\dots, 9\\}$. Empirical $\\chi^2$ and Kolmogorov-Smirnov distance tests flag artificially inflated review and install metrics.\n",
        "2. **Review Sentiment-Rating Dissonance**: Cross-evaluates app star ratings ($1.0 \\le r \\le 5.0$) against NLP sentiment polarity ($-1.0 \\le p \\le 1.0$), capturing paid 5-star review farms and 1-star brigading.\n",
        "3. **Shannon Lexical Entropy**: $H(X) = -\\sum_{w} p(w) \\log_2 p(w)$ and token repetition ratios to isolate canned spam templates and bot bursts.\n",
        "4. **Multivariate Mahalanobis Outlier Detection**: Regularized category-level covariance matrices $\\mathbf{\\Sigma}_{reg}^{-1}$ evaluating $[\log(\\text{Installs}), \\log(\\text{Reviews}), \\text{Rating}, \\text{Size}, \\log(\\text{Price})]$ to expose ghost apps and pricing extortion.\n",
        "5. **Composite App Trust & Integrity Scorecard (ATIS: 0–100)**: Multi-pillar risk synthesis classifying apps into Verified Organic, Normal Trust, Elevated Suspicion, and Critical Fraud Alert.\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
