      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 1. Benford's Law First-Digit Goodness-of-Fit Testing\n",
        "\n",
        "Testing whether leading digits of catalog reviews and installs conform to the logarithmic distribution:\n",
        "$$\\chi^2 = \\sum_{d=1}^9 \\frac{(O_d - E_d)^2}{E_d}, \\quad df = 8$$\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "benford_reviews = engine.test_benfords_law(engine._apps_df[\"Reviews\"].dropna(), metric_name=\"Reviews\")\n",
        "print(f\"Reviews Chi2: {benford_reviews.chi2_stat:.2f}, p-value: {benford_reviews.p_value:.6f}\")\n",
        "print(f\"Conformance Tier: {benford_reviews.conformance_tier}\")\n",
        "\n",
        "benford_installs = engine.test_benfords_law(engine._apps_df[\"Installs\"].dropna(), metric_name=\"Installs\")\n",
        "print(f\"Installs Chi2: {benford_installs.chi2_stat:.2f}, p-value: {benford_installs.p_value:.6f}\")\n",
        "print(f\"Conformance Tier: {benford_installs.conformance_tier}\")\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 2. Review Sentiment-Rating Dissonance & Bot Entropy Analysis\n",
        "\n",
        "Detecting incongruence between user star rating and textual sentiment polarity, plus Shannon lexical entropy.\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "sample_apps = [\"Subway Surfers\", \"Coloring book moana\", \"DU Battery Saver\"]\n",
        "for app_name in sample_apps:\n",
        "    res = engine.evaluate_review_dissonance(app_name)\n",
        "    print(f\"App: {app_name}\")\n",
        "    print(f\"  Rating: {res.star_rating}, Mean Polarity: {res.mean_polarity:.3f}\")\n",
        "    print(f\"  Dissonance Score: {res.dissonance_score:.3f}, Lexical Entropy: {res.lexical_entropy:.2f}\")\n",
        "    print(f\"  Bot Suspicion: {res.bot_suspicion_tier}\")\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
