        "\n",
        "Evaluating multi-dimensional distance from category-calibrated baselines:\n",
        "$$D_M(\\mathbf{x}) = \\sqrt{(\\mathbf{x} - \\boldsymbol{\\mu}_c)^T \\mathbf{\\Sigma}_{reg}^{-1} (\\mathbf{x} - \\boldsymbol{\\mu}_c)}$$\n"
      ]
    },
